OL,3,GNEWSADriver who fled to Latvia after
OL,4,Akilling schoolboy jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding driver who fled to Latvia
OL,7,Fafter killing a 12-year-old boy when he
OL,8,Fhit him at more than 70mph has been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FAleksanders Dolars evaded capture for
OL,12,FKeaton Slater's death for more than two
OL,13,Fyears because there was no extradition
OL,14,Ftreaty between Latvia and the UK
OL,15,Fpost-Brexit.
OL,17,FHe was finally brought to justice in
OL,18,FAugust this year when he was brought to
OL,19,FEngland to appear at Warwick Crown
OL,20,FCourt following a determined campaign
OL,21,Fby Keaton's parents.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
