OL,3,GNEWSADriver who fled to Latvia after
OL,4,Akilling schoolboy jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolars, 23, was jailed for nine years
OL,7,Fand four months by Judge Kristina
OL,8,FMontgomery KC who told him: "Your
OL,9,Fselfish and dangerous driving took his
OL,10,Flife." Keaton's family said the
OL,11,Fsentence was not long enough.
